      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The cache doesn't seem to be working correctly. I have to re-download worlds and avatars, mostly avatars, minutes after loading them, even my own. I check my cache, which is supposed to be limited to 10gb, and it's 40-50gb, but not caching everything recent like it's supposed to. This while my ram is being entirely consumed by the game supposedly caching every little thing it sees, but somehow it still takes 40 seconds or more to load into an avatar I was just in 5 minutes ago.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
